    "title": "Marine Captain Watch Face",
    "description": "The Marine Captain Watch Face for Wear OS offers 6 customizable slots for complications. There are 3 positions: left, right, and bottom. Each position can accommodate 2 complications, which will rotate, alternating with each other.\r\n\r\nTapping the center of the watch face makes the hands transparent, allowing you to better see the complications (available only on watches). If you have reverse complications installed, then when you tap the center of the watch face again, the complications will flip manually with each tap.\r\n\r\nThe app on your phone is necessary for setting up the Marine Captain watch face and transmitting the phone\u2019s battery level to the watch. You can create your own themes only from the app on your phone. The Marine Captain watch face can be configured from the watch.\r\n\r\n<b>Built-in complications and Features:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Weather: Requires access to your location. Displays the current weather, upcoming temperature changes, and wind speed. If adverse weather is expected in the near future, this will be shown in the complication. The weather forecast works without internet access (usually up to 2 days) using a previously downloaded forecast.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Financial data: Displays currencies, cryptocurrencies (Bitcoin BTC, Ethereum ETH, etc.), stocks (AAPL, GOOG, etc.), futures (gold, brent oil, etc.), ETFs, funds, and stock indices (e.g., S&P 500).\r\n\r\n\u2022 Tides: Requires access to your location and may not be supported in all countries and regions. Shows the tide forecast of the nearest tide measuring station to you.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Air Pollution: may not be supported in all countries and regions.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Calendar events in the Logo complication: Requires read access from the calendar.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Data from Health Services: Shows data such as heart rate, steps, distance, calories, and floors, depending on the model of your watch.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Date: Date with sunrise/sunset time and moon phase.\r\n\r\n\u2022 World time: Allows you to view the current time in various locations around the world.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Sensors: Includes a barometer and altimeter. The altimeter uses only barometric data to calculate altitude (barometric altimeter). The altimeter requires access to your location to obtain barometric data above sea level at your location.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Hourly Chime: Provides hourly alerts, sound and vibration are available.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Third-party developer complications: Allows you to use complications from third-party developers. Can only be configured from the watch.\r\n\r\n<b>Built-in apps:</b>\r\n\r\nThese apps can be installed as shortcuts if the corresponding complication is installed:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Weather: Displays an hourly forecast in a circular format. You can scroll through the forecast (tap and hold the highlighted area and rotate). The next screen displays a forecast for up to 6 days.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Tides: Shows a tide chart for up to 6 days.\r\n\r\n<b>Attention:</b>\r\n\r\nThe app on the phone is necessary to transmit the phone\u2019s battery level to the watch. Without the app installed on the phone, the phone\u2019s battery level will not be displayed on the watch.\r\n\r\nThe Premium license only removes the \u201cFree Version\u201d watermark at the bottom of the watch face screen. All functions and complications of the watch face are available for free.\r\n\r\nRequirements for Marine Captain Watch Face:\r\n\u2022 Watch Face: smartwatch with Wear OS 4.0 only.\r\n\u2022 Mobile app: mobile device with Android 13 or higher.",
